		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  lenteur de lecture sur les foreign tables.]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=20961#p20961"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour,</p><p>Voici les tests fait:<br />ifconfig eth0 | grep -Eo &quot;MTU:[0-9]+&quot;<br />MTU:1500 ==&gt; Pour les deux machines donc latence 7,7772ms<br />==<br />dd if=/dev/zero of=test bs=100M count=1; scp test usertest@xxxxx1:/dev/null;<br />1+0 records in<br />1+0 records out<br />104857600 bytes (105 MB) copied, 0.297704 s, 352 MB/s<br />test&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;100%&#160; 100MB&#160; 50.0MB/s&#160; &#160;00:02<br />===========</p><p>Est ce que je devrai fournir d&#039;autres metriques?</p><p>Bien à toi</p>]]></content>
